#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:59
msgid "Secure | Confidential | Multilingual | For All Cultures"
msgstr "安全 | 保密 | 多语言 | 面向所有文化"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:82
msgid "Personal Information"
msgstr "个人信息"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:125
msgid "Contact Information"
msgstr "联系信息"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:127
msgid "Provide a safe way for our team to contact you, if available."
msgstr "如有可能，请提供我们团队联系您的安全方式。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:157
msgid "Every person deserves access to justice."
msgstr "每个人都应享有获得公正的权利。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:165
msgid "Immigration Case Information"
msgstr "移民案件信息"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:167
msgid "Only fill in what you know — it's okay to leave parts blank."
msgstr ""

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:174
msgid "Yes, I am detained"
msgstr "是的，我被拘留了"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:175
msgid "Are you currently detained?"
msgstr "您目前是否被拘留？"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:212
msgid "Asylum Screening"
msgstr "庇护资格审查"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:214
msgid "Share only what you feel safe sharing. There is no wrong answer."
msgstr ""

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:219
msgid "Why do you fear returning to your home country?"
msgstr "您为什么害怕返回您的母国？"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:221
msgid "Please provide as much detail as you safely can."
msgstr "请在安全范围内尽可能详细地描述。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:228
msgid "Have you experienced past harm or persecution?"
msgstr "您是否曾经历过伤害或迫害？"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:230
msgid "Please describe what happened, if you can."
msgstr "如果可以，请描述发生了什么。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:237
msgid ""
"What countries did you travel through, and did you apply for asylum in those "
"countries?"
msgstr "您途经了哪些国家，您是否在这些国家申请过庇护？"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:239
msgid ""
"List each country and whether you requested protection there, if applicable."
msgstr "请列出每个国家以及您是否在那里寻求过保护（如适用）。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:248
msgid "Yes, family members are included"
msgstr "是的，包含家庭成员"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:249
msgid "Are family members included in your case?"
msgstr "您的案件中是否包含家庭成员？"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:258
msgid "Your information is submitted for confidential intake review."
msgstr "您的信息将被提交进行保密审查。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_form.html:266
msgid "Consent and Acknowledgment"
msgstr "同意与确认"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:4
msgid "Intake Submitted | Universal Removal Defense Project"
msgstr "申请已提交 | Universal Removal Defense Project"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:5
msgid ""
"Your intake has been securely submitted to Universal Removal Defense Project."
msgstr "您的申请已安全提交至 Universal Removal Defense Project。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:17
msgid ""
"View this confirmation in the language that is most comfortable for you."
msgstr "用您最熟悉的语言查看此确认信息。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:43
msgid "Intake Successfully Submitted"
msgstr "申请已成功提交"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:45
msgid ""
"Thank you for contacting Universal Removal Defense Project. Your intake has "
"been securely submitted for preliminary review."
msgstr ""
"感谢您联系 Universal Removal Defense Project。您的申请已安全提交以进行初步审"
"查。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:51
msgid ""
"Submission of this intake form does not create an attorney-client or "
"representative relationship."
msgstr "提交此申请表不会建立律师-当事人关系或代理关系。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:52
msgid ""
"URDP must complete conflict screening and determine eligibility before "
"representation may begin."
msgstr "URDP 必须完成利益冲突审查并确定资格，代理才能开始。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:55
msgid "What Happens Next?"
msgstr "接下来会发生什么？"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:57
msgid "Your submission will be reviewed by URDP staff."
msgstr "您的申请将由 URDP 工作人员审查。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:58
msgid "Additional information or documentation may be requested."
msgstr "可能会要求您提供额外信息或文件。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:59
msgid "If accepted, you will be contacted regarding next steps."
msgstr "如果被接受，我们将与您联系告知后续步骤。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:60
msgid "Please monitor your email and phone for follow-up communication."
msgstr "请留意您的电子邮件和电话，以便接收后续通讯。"

#: intake/templates/intake/intake_success.html:64
msgid "Submit Another Intake"
msgstr "提交另一份申请"

